This is the ISHARE website: a static multi-page site (HTML/CSS/vanilla JS,
no framework, no backend in this repo).

## Deploy

Hosted on Cloudflare Pages, connected directly to this repo's `main` branch.
Pushing to `main` automatically builds and deploys — there is no manual
deploy step and no GitHub Pages workflow anymore. Never suggest re-adding a
GitHub Actions deploy step or a GitHub Pages config; Cloudflare's own Git
integration already handles it.

## Large media (videos/images)

Cloudflare Pages hard-limits any single deployed file to 25 MiB. Never commit
a large video or image file directly to this repo. Instead, upload it to the
`ishare-website-assets` R2 bucket and reference the public `r2.dev` URL from
the HTML — follow the pattern already used by the existing `<video>`/`<source>`
tags that point at an `r2.dev` URL.

## Known issues (do not "fix" without being asked)

- `culture/holodomor.html` references `../img/hrec.mp4`, which does not exist
  in this repo. This is a pre-existing broken reference, unrelated to the
  Cloudflare Pages migration. Leave it as-is unless the user explicitly asks
  you to fix it.
